# Build outputs. Every compiled binary and packaged release is produced by
# `go build` or deploy/manual/build-release.ps1 -- nothing in the build or the
# deploy reads a copy out of the repository. 153 MB of them had accumulated at
# HEAD, and because binaries barely delta-compress that was the entire cost of
# the Jenkins Checkout stage: a shallow clone still transfers every blob at
# HEAD, so the stage went from seconds to 6-7 minutes.
dist/
*.exe
*.zip
/.superpowers/
/docs/middleware_db/
/modbus-api-middleware/Site/
/services/platform-api/data/
/.worktrees/
